+// This Pine Script™ is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License 2.0
+// © SMC Trading System
+//@version=6
+indicator("SMC Premium/Discount Confluence Engine v17.54.2", shorttitle="SMC PD v17", overlay=true, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=500, max_boxes_count=500)
+// v17.54.2: Removed global max_bars_back=5000 — it forced 5000-bar buffers on ALL variables,
+// exceeding TradingView memory limits on data-dense charts (e.g. 5M USDJPY).
+// Targeted max_bars_back applied only to variables that need deep historical lookback.
+
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.54.2 CHANGELOG — Stability & HUD Fix (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-27] v17.54.2 — Stability & HUD Reliability Fix
+//
+// BUG FIX: "Indicator error" crash on data-dense charts (5M USDJPY)
+//   - Removed global max_bars_back=5000 from indicator() — forced 5000-bar buffers
+//     on ALL variables, exceeding TradingView memory limits on dense timeframes
+//   - Removed max_bars_back(time, 5000) global override
+//   - Added targeted max_bars_back only on zone bar-index arrays that need it
+//
+// BUG FIX: HUD table disappearing intermittently
+//   - Moved `var table hud = table.new(...)` OUTSIDE barstate.islast block
+//   - Table object now created once on first bar (var), populated on last bar
+//   - Prevents HUD from vanishing during chart navigation/replay
+//
+// OPTIMIZATION: Zone rendering loops
+//   - Added empty-array guards to skip zone drawing when no zones exist
+//   - Added zone age pruning: zones older than 500 bars auto-removed to prevent
+//     deep historical lookback and box.new referencing ancient bar_index values
+//   - Replaced math.max(size-1, 0) pattern with explicit size check
+//
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.54.1 CHANGELOG — Asian & Daily Level Visibility (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-17] v17.54.1 — Visual-Only Update (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+//
+// ENHANCEMENT: Asian Session & Daily Level Visibility Boost
+//   - Daily H/L lines: color.blue transparency 30→0, width 1→2, labels fully opaque
+//   - Asian H/L lines: color.orange transparency 30→0, width 1→2, labels fully opaque
+//   - Daily labels: bg color.new(color.blue,80)→color.new(color.blue,0), text white(0), size.small
+//   - Asian labels: bg color.new(color.orange,80)→color.new(color.orange,0), text white(0), size.small
+//   - Line styles preserved: Daily=dashed, Asian=dotted
+//   - Plot budget unchanged: 33/64
+//
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.22 CHANGELOG — FINAL EQ LINE FIX + HUD TEXT UNIFORMITY
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-16] v17.22 — Visual-Only Update (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+//
+// FIX 1: HUD TEXT UNIFORMITY
+//   - ALL value cells now use the same bright silver color (color.silver, 0%)
+//   - Matches the "MSS-Retrace" Entry Mode color for uniform readability
+//   - REMOVED all conditional dimming (gray30) for inactive rows
+//   - Color exceptions preserved:
+//     * INVALIDATED/killed → color.red (0%)
+//     * TRAP BUY/TRAP SELL → color.orange (0%)
+//     * ALIGNED → color.lime (0%)
+//     * Signal fired (FIRE stage, alerts, signals today) → color.lime (0%)
+//     * Everything else → color.silver (0%) — bright, uniform
+//
+// FIX 2: EQ LINE — FINAL ROOT CAUSE FIX (delete-and-redraw EVERY bar)
+//   - REMOVED barstate.islast guard — line now redraws on EVERY bar
+//   - Uses user-specified exact pattern: delete → line.new(bar_index-1..bar_index)
+//   - extend=extend.right ensures full chart coverage from a 1-bar segment
+//   - EQ label also uses delete-and-redraw every bar
+//   - eq_level calculated as exact (h4RangeHigh + h4RangeLow) / 2.0
+//   - Width=5, color=white, style=solid — maximum visibility
+//
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.20 CHANGELOG — CRITICAL EQ LINE Z-ORDER FIX + NAVY BLUE HUD
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-16] v17.20 — Visual-Only Update (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+//
+// FIX 1 (CRITICAL): EQ Line Z-Order — NOW VISIBLE ABOVE P&D ZONE BOXES
+//   - ROOT CAUSE: EQ line was drawn inside the same block as zone boxes,
+//     causing the filled box area to paint over the line on the chart.
+//   - SOLUTION: Separated EQ line + label into its own dedicated block that
+//     executes AFTER all box drawing, using delete-and-redraw every bar.
+//   - Pattern: line.delete(pdEqLine) → line.new() ensures line is ALWAYS
+//     the last visual element rendered (topmost z-order layer).
+//   - Width increased: 4 → 5 for maximum visibility
+//   - Color: color.white (pure white, 0% transparency)
+//   - Style: line.style_solid, extend.right
+//   - EQ Label: solid black background (0% transparency), size.normal
+//
+// FIX 2: HUD Navy Blue Background
+//   - REMOVED: color.new(color.black, 40) — old black glass
+//   - REPLACED: color.new(#1a237e, 20) — Deep Navy Blue, 80% visible
+//   - Header row: color.new(#0d47a1, 10) — Brighter navy for prominence
+//   - Table frame border: color.new(color.white, 60) — visible white border
+//
+// FIX 3: HUD Color Hierarchy Update
+//   - All labels: color.white
+//   - Active values: color.new(color.lime, 0)
+//   - Inactive values: color.new(color.silver, 0)
+//   - Warnings: color.new(color.orange, 0)
+//   - Invalidated: color.new(color.red, 0)
+//
+// Plot budget: 33/64 (unchanged — no new plots)
+// ZERO logic/filter/alert architecture changes
+// ============================================================================
+
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.19 CHANGELOG — CRITICAL EQ LINE FIX + HUD VISIBILITY IMPROVEMENTS
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-16] v17.19 — Visual-Only Update (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+//
+// FIX 1 (CRITICAL): P&D Equilibrium Line
+//   - Fixed EQ label accumulation: now tracked via var label + label.delete()
+//   - EQ label padded ("  EQ  ") with dark background (transp 20) for visibility
+//   - Line remains: width=4, color.white, solid, extend.right
+//
+// FIX 2: HUD High-Contrast Background
+//   - Background: 60% opacity (color.new(color.black, 40)) — was 30% (70 transp)
+//   - Added 1px frame border: color.new(color.white, 80) for terminal-style panel
+//
+// FIX 3: HUD Float Mode
+//   - New input: HUD Mode = "Fixed" (default) or "Hover"
+//   - Fixed: always 60% opacity
+//   - Hover inactive: 15% opacity (transp 85), active on recent signal/last bar: 60%
+//
+// FIX 4: HUD Size Optimization
+//   - Content rows: size.small (was size.normal) — ~15% width reduction
+//   - Labels shortened: "Alignment"→"Align", "Kill Zone"→"KZ", "Confluence"→"Confl",
+//     "AMD Phase"→"AMD", "Trade Ctx"→"Trade", "Entry Mode"→"Entry",
+//     "Signal Stage"→"Stage", "Last Alert"→"Alert", "Signals Today"→"Signals"
+//   - Header row remains size.normal for prominence
+//
+// FIX 5: Text Priority Hierarchy
+//   - Headers: color.white (bright white)
+//   - Active values: color.lime (bright green)
+//   - Neutral: color.new(color.gray, 30) (light grey)
+//   - Warnings: color.orange
+//   - Invalidated: color.red
+//
+// Plot budget: 33/64 (unchanged — no new plots)
+// ============================================================================
+
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.18 CHANGELOG — HIGH-VISIBILITY UI UPDATE
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-16] v17.18 — HIGH-VISIBILITY Visual Update (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+//
+// FIX 1: HUD High-Impact Overhaul
+//   - Font size: size.small → size.normal (15% larger globally)
+//   - Labels: Bright white (#FFFFFF) — was dim 40% transparent
+//   - Background: 30% opacity (color.new(color.black, 70)) — was 15% (85 transp)
+//   - Inactive rows: Lighter grey (#A0A0A0 equiv, transp 40) — was 30
+//   - All value text rendered at size.normal for maximum readability
+//
+// FIX 2: Commanding Equilibrium Line
+//   - Width: 4 (was 3)
+//   - Color: color.white (0% transparency) — was color.new(color.white, 20)
+//   - EQ label: size.normal with opaque black background patch
+//   - EQ label style: label.style_label_left (was label.style_none)
+//
+// FIX 3: P&D Zone Color Brightening
+//   - Premium fill: color.new(color.red, 85) — was 92
+//   - Premium border: color.new(color.red, 70) — was 80
+//   - Discount fill: color.new(color.green, 85) — was 92
+//   - Discount border: color.new(color.green, 70) — was 80
+//
+// Plot budget: 33/64 (unchanged — ZERO new plots)
+// ZERO logic/filter/alert architecture changes
+// ============================================================================
+
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.16 CHANGELOG — SESSION LEVELS, PROOF-OF-LIFE, UI REFINEMENTS
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-16] v17.16 — Confluence Engine Expansion & Signal Audit Layer
+//
+// PRIORITY 1 — VISUAL SESSION LEVELS:
+//   1. Daily High/Low lines (line.new, extend.right) with labels
+//   2. Asian Session High/Low lines (Tokyo 00:00-09:00 UTC) with labels
+//   3. Confluence scoring expanded from 6 to 8 components:
+//      (7) Daily H/L proximity — score 0-100 based on distance to Daily H or L
+//      (8) Asian H/L proximity — score 0-100 based on distance to Asian H or L
+//   4. Guardian context updated to consider session level proximity
+//
+// PRIORITY 2 — SIGNAL PROOF-OF-LIFE:
+//   1. Toggleable "Show Proof-of-Life" overlay (default = true)
+//   2. Session signal counter — tracks signals fired per session
+//   3. Heartbeat indicator — small green dot when system is active/scanning
+//   4. Counter displayed in HUD as additional row
+//
+// PRIORITY 3 — UI REFINEMENTS:
+//   1. HUD background: 100% transparent → 85% opacity glass tint
+//   2. Debug rows hidden by default (new "Show Debug Rows" toggle, default=false)
+//   3. Zone Debug rows gated behind new toggle
+//
+// Plot budget: 33/64 (+2 from v17.15: heartbeat plotshape + signal counter plot)
+// ============================================================================
+
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.15 CHANGELOG — PRO-GLASS HUD OVERHAUL
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-15] v17.15 — Pro-Glass UI: 3-Pillar Columnar HUD
+//
+// VISUAL OVERHAUL:
+//   1. HUD moved to TOP RIGHT with 100% transparent background (no box)
+//   2. Mono-spaced font (size.small) for clean alignment
+//   3. 3 horizontal pillars to minimize vertical space:
+//      Pillar A (Context):   Bias, Alignment, Kill Zone
+//      Pillar B (Signal):    Sniper Progress, POI Score, Momentum, Guardian
+//      Pillar C (Execution): AMD Phase, Trade Context, Entry Mode, Action Step
+//   4. Removed "SMC Equilibrium" label — replaced with thin dashed line only
+//   5. No greyed-out rows — inactive data shows dim grey text, transparent bg
+//   6. Removed State Machine, Hierarchy, Displacement rows (consolidated)
+//   7. Action Plan appended to Action Step row (saves space)
+//   8. Last Alert row retained as footer
+//   9. Zone Debug rows retained (toggled, below footer)
+//
+// Plot budget: 31/64 (unchanged — HUD uses table.cell only, no plot cost)
+// ============================================================================
+
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.14.1 CHANGELOG — KILL ZONE PAYLOAD INTEGRATION
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-13] v17.14.1 — Add Kill Zone to webhook alert payloads
+//   - Added "kill_zone": {{plot_12}} to all 4 alertcondition() JSON payloads
+//   - kzCode was already exposed as plot_12 since v17.12.3; now included in alerts
+//   - Kill Zone mapping: 0=Off-Session, 1=London, 2=NY AM, 3=NY PM, 4=Asian
+//   - Enables session-based analytics in TradeX tracker
+//   - Updated version strings from "v17.14" to "v17.14.1"
+//   - No logic, plot budget, or visual changes
+//
+// [2026-05-13] v17.14 — Fix chart spam, harden dedup, restore production thresholds
+//
+// BUG 1 — CHART LABEL SPAM (P0):
+//   Debug labels (label.new) fired on EVERY historical bar that met conditions.
+//   With thresholds at 0, this created hundreds of overlapping labels.
+//   FIX: Debug labels now gated by barstate.islastconfirmedhistory (last bar only).
+//   Additionally, labels use var+delete pattern — max 1 label per alert type.
+//
+// BUG 2 — WEAK DEDUP ON HISTORY:
+//   setup_id changes every bar (confluence/stage shift), so dedup was ineffective.
+//   FIX: Dedup now uses DIRECTION+ZONE only (e.g. "BULL_DZ") — stable across bars.
+//   Cooldown is purely bar-count based, no longer bypassed by setup_id change.
+//
+// BUG 3 — RE10045 EMPTY ARRAY (from v17.13):
+//   for loop on empty debug arrays crashed. FIX: if dbg_rows > 0 guard.
+//
+// BUG 4 — CE10123 SERIES STRING IN ALERTCONDITION (from v17.13):
