@@ -0,0 +1,2855 @@
+// This Pine Script™ is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License 2.0
+// © SMC Trading System
+//@version=6
+indicator("SMC Premium/Discount Confluence Engine v17.54.3", shorttitle="SMC PD v17", overlay=true, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=500, max_boxes_count=500)
+// v17.54.3: HUD safety hardening — f_safeText(), f_setCell() wrappers, bounds checking.
+// v17.54.2: Removed global max_bars_back=5000, zone age pruning, HUD init outside barstate.islast.
+
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.54.3 CHANGELOG — HUD Safety Hardening (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-27] v17.54.3 — HUD Safety Patterns for Maximum Stability
+//
+// SAFETY 1: f_safeText() wrapper function
+//   - Returns "—" for na/null values, prevents na-crash in HUD text
+//   - Applied to ALL dynamic string values before HUD cell writes
+//
+// SAFETY 2: f_setCell() / f_setHdrCell() / f_setDbgCell() wrapper functions
+//   - Bounds-check column and row indices against maxHudCols/maxHudRows
+//   - na-check table reference before every write
+//   - Prevents array out-of-bounds and cell update failures
+//   - Three variants: standard (size.small), header (size.normal), debug (size.tiny)
+//
+// SAFETY 3: Hard limit constants
+//   - maxHudRows = 21, maxHudCols = 2 (exact fit for 21-row HUD, see Row Map)
+//   - All cell writes validated against these limits
+//
+// SAFETY 4: HUD initialization guard (reinforced from v17.54.2)
+//   - var table hud = na at global scope
+//   - table.new() only called if na(hud) — guaranteed single creation
+//   - barstate.islast block gated by not na(hud)
+//
+// ============================================================================
+// v17.54.2 CHANGELOG — Stability & HUD Fix (NO logic/filter/alert changes)
+// ============================================================================
+// [2026-05-27] v17.54.2 — Stability & HUD Reliability Fix
+//
+// BUG FIX: "Indicator error" crash on data-dense charts (5M USDJPY)
+//   - Removed global max_bars_back=5000 from indicator() — forced 5000-bar buffers
+//     on ALL variables, exceeding TradingView memory limits on dense timeframes
+//   - Removed max_bars_back(time, 5000) global override
+//   - Added targeted max_bars_back only on zone bar-index arrays that need it
